<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/msa@/~cl_15__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/msa@/~cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/msa@> .
