<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/msa@/~cl_30> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "30" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/msa@> .
